Comment: 0,0:00:21.91,0:00:23.96,Sign-WitchNameRunes,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(0,320)\pos(960,40)\blur1\c&HD1DADA&}Oktavia von Seckendorff
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.49,0:24:19.32,Ending-ImHome-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,0)\be2\blur3}What does your heart, rusted to brown,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.32,0:24:24.54,Ending-ImHome-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,320)\be2\blur3}see in this world bereft of sounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.54,0:24:28.99,Ending-ImHome-English,,0,0,0,,{\be2\blur3}I try to find the courage to say goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.99,0:24:31.74,Ending-ImHome-English,,0,0,0,,{\be2\blur3}Always, never succeeding
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.74,0:24:34.57,Ending-ImHome-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,320)\be2\blur3}When I came to
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.57,0:24:38.91,Ending-ImHome-English,,0,0,0,,{\be2\blur3}I saw you from afar, crying all alone
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.91,0:24:40.59,Ending-ImHome-English,,0,0,0,,{\be2\blur3}How painful
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.59,0:24:43.52,Ending-ImHome-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,320)\be2\blur3}and sad it felt there
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.52,0:24:47.48,Ending-ImHome-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1080)\be2\blur3}I want to link hands with you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.60,0:24:51.45,Ending-ImHome-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,320)\be2\blur3}Call me by my name, again and again
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.45,0:24:55.02,Ending-ImHome-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,320)\be2\blur3}Whatever the future may hold for us
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.02,0:25:02.94,Ending-ImHome-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,320)\be2\blur3}I can't let go, and merely thinking of it pains my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.94,0:25:04.88,Ending-ImHome-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,320)\be2\blur3}Here I am
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.88,0:25:06.80,Ending-ImHome-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,320)\be2\blur3}Here I am
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.80,0:25:12.02,Ending-ImHome-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1280)\be2\blur3}Is this where I belong?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.12,0:25:14.98,Ending-ImHome-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)\be2\blur3}The feelings I leave behind
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.98,0:25:20.55,Ending-ImHome-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1920)\be2\blur3}will never falter
Dialogue: 5,0:00:04.90,0:00:10.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever we pray for someone's happiness, \Nsomeone else must be cursed in exchange.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:11.15,0:00:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out that's how we magical girls work.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:17.79,0:00:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I really was an idiot.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:34.45,0:00:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:48.17,0:00:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...
Dialogue: 5,0:00:49.51,0:00:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 5,0:00:51.53,0:00:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do to Sayaka?!
Dialogue: 5,0:00:57.29,0:00:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand back.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:04.79,0:01:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Take my hand.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:06.24,0:01:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:08.54,0:01:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Just do it.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:16.68,0:01:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 5,0:01:18.14,0:01:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you let go of my hand,\N you'll be frozen in time as well.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:21.60,0:01:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So hold on tight.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:22.51,0:01:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going on?!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:24.45,0:01:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd that witch come from?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:25.68,0:01:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That is what was once Miki Sayaka.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:28.39,0:01:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw it happen yourself, did you not?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:30.77,0:01:32.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we just gonna run away?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:32.21,0:01:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't like it, toss that useless hunk of meat aside and we'll kill it here and now.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:37.33,0:01:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you do that?
Dialogue: 5,0:01:38.17,0:01:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Like hell I can!
Dialogue: 5,0:01:39.39,0:01:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nothing but a\N burden to me right now.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:42.63,0:01:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We should withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.01,0:01:58.06,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{OP}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.98,0:03:28.02,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Episode}
Dialogue: 5,0:03:52.29,0:03:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{*}-chan{*}?!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:54.17,0:03:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{*}-chan{*}, what's wrong?!
Dialogue: 5,0:03:57.84,0:04:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's her Soul Gem?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:00.00,0:04:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What happened to Sayaka{*}-chan{*}?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:01.98,0:04:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Her Soul Gem turned into a Grief Seed, \Ngiving birth to a new witch, and was no more.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:12.30,0:04:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No... You're lying, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:14.64,0:04:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the truth.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:16.46,0:04:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the final secret of the Soul Gems.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:19.71,0:04:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,When these gems darken and cloud over,
Dialogue: 5,0:04:22.98,0:04:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,we turn into Grief Seeds\Nand are reborn as witches.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:28.87,0:04:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the inescapable fate of all who become magical girls.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:35.50,0:04:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:38.07,0:04:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be true.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:39.04,0:04:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:47.18,0:04:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But... how could that be?
Dialogue: 5,0:04:50.44,0:04:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{*}-chan{*} just wanted to\Nsave people from the witches.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:54.90,0:04:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,She just wanted to fight\N for what was right.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:57.89,0:05:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the reason she\Nbecame a magical girl.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:01.57,0:05:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So why...
Dialogue: 5,0:05:02.44,0:05:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,She just ended up bearing a curse of equal magnitude to her wish.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:07.47,0:05:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, she will live to curse as many people as she saved.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:24.30,0:05:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell do you think you are?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:27.42,0:05:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you get off on acting like you know it all, or what?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:30.72,0:05:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you stay so calm\N at a time like this?
Dialogue: 5,0:05:33.43,0:05:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka was her...
Dialogue: 5,0:05:36.79,0:05:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka was her best friend.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:40.69,0:05:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you understand now what it was that you aspired to become.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:48.41,0:05:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you've brought her corpse along, \Nyou'll need to dispose of it carefully.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:52.87,0:05:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If you just dump it somewhere, \Nyou'll run into trouble later.
Dialogue: 5,0:05:56.99,0:05:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you even call yourself human?!
Dialogue: 5,0:05:59.07,0:06:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't, of course.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:01.99,0:06:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And neither can you.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:20.69,0:06:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,May I come in?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:22.18,0:06:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to talk to you about something.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:24.40,0:06:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you're alive after all.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:28.43,0:06:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it true? What Homura{*}-chan{*} said.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:31.96,0:06:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,There was nothing wrong\N enough to require correction.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:36.66,0:06:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So you've been turning us into magical girls just so we'd become witches?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:41.67,0:06:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't misunderstand.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:44.07,0:06:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't do this out of\Nill will toward mankind.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:48.66,0:06:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything we've done has been to\Nextend the lifespan of the universe.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:52.56,0:06:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka, do you know the term "entropy"?
Dialogue: 5,0:06:57.48,0:06:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,To give a simple example,
Dialogue: 5,0:06:59.07,0:07:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,the amount of energy released by a bonfire
Dialogue: 5,0:07:01.19,0:07:04.20,Default,,0,0,0,,is less than the amount it took\Nto grow the wood it's made of.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:04.68,0:07:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,In short, when energy changes form, some of it gets lost.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:08.18,0:07:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,As a result, the amount of usable energy in the universe is constantly decreasing.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:12.51,0:07:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we searched for a form of energy not bound by the laws of thermodynamics,
Dialogue: 5,0:07:18.17,0:07:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,and what we discovered was
Dialogue: 5,0:07:19.75,0:07:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,the energy generated by magical girls.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:23.75,0:07:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What... are you?
Dialogue: 5,0:07:27.13,0:07:34.23,Default,,1,1,0,,Our civilization developed technology that could convert the emotions of sentient lifeforms into energy.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:34.23,0:07:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But unfortunately, we ourselves did not possess the capability for emotion.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:39.36,0:07:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So we studied various\Nspecies across the universe,
Dialogue: 5,0:07:43.08,0:07:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and eventually found mankind.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:48.44,0:07:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Given your population and reproductive rate,
Dialogue: 5,0:07:51.66,0:07:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,it's clear that the amount of emotional energy generated by each individual
Dialogue: 5,0:07:54.35,0:07:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,is greater than the amount expended during its birth and growth.
Dialogue: 5,0:07:59.39,0:08:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Your souls are energy sources capable of defying entropy.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:05.54,0:08:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And the most effective of all are girls in their second stage of development,
Dialogue: 5,0:08:09.98,0:08:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,who often fluctuate between hope and despair.{cps}
Dialogue: 5,0:08:12.58,0:08:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,At the moment when your Soul Gems flare out and turn into Grief Seeds,
Dialogue: 5,0:08:18.19,0:08:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,a tremendous amount of energy is produced.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:20.35,0:08:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,As Incubators, it is our job\N to collect that energy.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:25.97,0:08:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we just disposable\N energy sources to you, then?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:29.69,0:08:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying we should just die for you?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:32.69,0:08:36.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea how many \Ncivilizations coexist across the universe,
Dialogue: 5,0:08:36.21,0:08:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and how much energy they\N consume in a single second?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:40.10,0:08:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Eventually, even you humans will be able to leave this planet and join us.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:45.85,0:08:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,When that day comes,
Dialogue: 5,0:08:47.31,0:08:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,you wouldn't want to venture out into an empty, desolate universe, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:08:50.30,0:08:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In the long run, this arrangement benefits mankind as well.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:56.72,0:08:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be serious.
Dialogue: 5,0:08:58.59,0:09:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me that ridiculous reason
Dialogue: 5,0:09:01.47,0:09:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,is why Mami{*}-san{*} had to die and\NSayaka{*}-chan{*} had to suffer so much?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:06.15,0:09:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That isn't right.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:07.89,0:09:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just too cruel!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:10.66,0:09:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But we ask for and receive your consent for every contract we make.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:15.14,0:09:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If anything, we've been very\Naccommodating in that respect.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:18.28,0:09:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But you do it by deceiving us!
Dialogue: 5,0:09:20.53,0:09:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The act of deception in itself\N is incomprehensible to us.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:24.80,0:09:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is it that when humans regret a decision based on a misunderstanding,
Dialogue: 5,0:09:28.52,0:09:31.29,Default,,0,0,0,,they feel resentment\Ntoward the other party?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:32.13,0:09:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even follow what you're saying.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:35.98,0:09:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't accept it at all.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:38.23,0:09:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a pretty hard time \Nunderstanding your value system too.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:42.96,0:09:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Your current population numbers over 6.9 billion and grows by ten every four seconds,
Dialogue: 5,0:09:49.03,0:09:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so why do you make such a fuss over the life or death of a few people?
Dialogue: 5,0:09:52.92,0:09:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's how you think,\N then you really {\i1}are{\i0} our enemy.
Dialogue: 5,0:09:59.56,0:10:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite that, I did come here to try and explain our actions to you.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:02.52,0:10:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted you to understand \Nhow wonderful your sacrifices are,
Dialogue: 5,0:10:08.52,0:10:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,but it doesn't look like that'll happen.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:10.25,0:10:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:11.92,0:10:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka, someday you will \Nbecome the greatest of all magical girls,
Dialogue: 5,0:10:16.74,0:10:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and then the most terrible of all witches.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:18.56,0:10:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,When that happens, I'm sure we will gain an unprecedented amount of energy.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:24.06,0:10:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So, if you ever feel like dying for the sake of the universe, just let me know.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:28.30,0:10:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be waiting.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:49.24,0:10:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so obsessed with\N keeping that body fresh?
Dialogue: 5,0:10:59.85,0:11:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there any way to get her Soul Gem back?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:02.88,0:11:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I know of.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:07.39,0:11:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,So there could be some way\N you {\i1}don't{\i0} know of?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:12.20,0:11:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,As magical girls, your existence already defies established logic.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:15.25,0:11:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be surprised no matter what\N implausible feats you managed to accomplish.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:19.90,0:11:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're saying it's possible?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:21.65,0:11:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,No one has ever done it before,
Dialogue: 5,0:11:23.64,0:11:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,so I don't know how you'd go about it.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:26.13,0:11:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I have no way of advising you on the matter.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:33.22,0:11:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't need your advice anyway.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:35.29,0:11:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,As if I'd ever accept help from {\i1}you{\i0}.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:46.97,0:11:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're looking a bit unwell\N this morning, Madoka{*}-san{*}.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:51.08,0:11:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 5,0:11:52.84,0:11:56.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I just didn't get enough sleep.
Dialogue: 5,0:11:56.20,0:11:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of which, is Sayaka{*}-san{*} absent again today?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:00.74,0:12:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I was thinking of going to see her after school,
Dialogue: 5,0:12:03.64,0:12:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm not sure if it'd be appropriate.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:06.40,0:12:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Things are a little awkward\N between us right now.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:10.77,0:12:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hitomi{*}-chan{*}, I—
Dialogue: 5,0:12:13.33,0:12:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}How can you still go to school after \Neverything that happened yesterday?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:23.57,0:12:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Madoka{*}-san{*}?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:24.84,0:12:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I need to talk to you.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:26.95,0:12:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Can you spare a moment?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:31.22,0:12:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hitomi{*}-chan{*}, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 5,0:12:33.97,0:12:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to school today either!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:36.80,0:12:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Ma... Madoka{*}-san{*}, wait!
Dialogue: 5,0:12:48.16,0:12:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, what did you want to talk about?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:50.70,0:12:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to save Miki Sayaka?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:53.83,0:12:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? We can save her?
Dialogue: 5,0:12:57.30,0:12:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If we couldn't, were you going to just leave her like that?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:02.05,0:13:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, that came out wrong.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:04.55,0:13:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This may sound foolish,
Dialogue: 5,0:13:07.27,0:13:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't want to give up until we \Nknow for sure that she can't be saved.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:17.26,0:13:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,She may have turned into a witch,
Dialogue: 5,0:13:19.57,0:13:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,but she might still be able to\Nremember her friends' voices.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:22.55,0:13:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you call out to her, she might regain her memories from when she was human.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:27.48,0:13:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone could do it, it'd be you.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:33.72,0:13:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think it'll work?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:35.31,0:13:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How would I know?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:39.29,0:13:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We're doing it {\i1}because{\i0} we don't know.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:41.46,0:13:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe if we slice that witch in half,
Dialogue: 5,0:13:46.25,0:13:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka's Soul Gem might fall out instead of a Grief Seed.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:52.48,0:13:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that be something?
Dialogue: 5,0:13:54.18,0:13:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be like one of those stories where love and courage triumph over all.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:00.35,0:14:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 5,0:14:02.22,0:14:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I probably became a magical girl in the first place because I loved stories like that.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:07.82,0:14:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd totally forgotten about it, \Nbut Sayaka reminded me again.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:13.99,0:14:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't wanna come, I won't force you.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:17.67,0:14:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be pretty dangerous, after all.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:21.04,0:14:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't promise I'll be able to protect you no matter what.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:26.63,0:14:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'll help you.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:29.86,0:14:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let me help.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:35.47,0:14:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Kaname Madoka.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:39.39,0:14:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, you're so gonna cramp my style.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:43.40,0:14:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:14:44.74,0:14:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Sakura Kyouko. We're a team now.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:48.78,0:14:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:59.55,0:15:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:00.94,0:15:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't feel very well. May I\Nhead to the nurse's office?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:05.19,0:15:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the health officer for this class?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:07.59,0:15:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaname{*}-san{*} is out today.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:10.70,0:15:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, the class rep should go with—
Dialogue: 5,0:15:22.05,0:15:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Homura{*}-chan{*} will help us out.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:25.52,0:15:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She wouldn't do something like that.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:28.02,0:15:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't she your friend?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:32.00,0:15:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:33.76,0:15:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess you could say\N we have a common goal.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:36.59,0:15:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,We just teamed up in order to take down\N something neither of us could handle alone.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:42.00,0:15:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,In a few days, the Walpurgisnacht will come to this city.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:48.55,0:15:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Walpurgis?
Dialogue: 5,0:15:50.58,0:15:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The mother lode of all witches.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:55.60,0:15:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt either of us could beat it on our own.
Dialogue: 5,0:15:59.21,0:16:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why we teamed up, so to speak.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:02.02,0:16:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's how it is between us.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:12.32,0:16:13.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:22.01,0:16:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if it really is Sayaka{*}-chan{*}.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:24.65,0:16:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be another witch instead?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:27.14,0:16:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The magic patterns are the same as the one from yesterday.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:29.69,0:16:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,It's definitely her.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:46.66,0:16:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to ask you this one more time.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:49.79,0:16:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really sure about this?
Dialogue: 5,0:16:51.85,0:16:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of used to this already.
Dialogue: 5,0:16:54.20,0:17:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm always trailing behind others, \Nnever useful for anything.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:01.77,0:17:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But please, take me with you.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:04.89,0:17:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one strange girl, aren't you?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:16.39,0:17:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kyouko{*}-chan{*}?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:18.48,0:17:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:19.75,0:17:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I a coward for always leaving the fighting to others,
Dialogue: 5,0:17:24.82,0:17:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,and never doing anything myself?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:27.74,0:17:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you ever become a magical girl?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:30.53,0:17:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? Because...
Dialogue: 5,0:17:33.23,0:17:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take this lightly.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:34.92,0:17:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't a job just anyone can do.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:38.23,0:17:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 5,0:17:39.42,0:17:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If you get to eat good food every day and live a happy life with your family,
Dialogue: 5,0:17:43.15,0:17:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,why would you give it all up to become a magical girl on some stupid whim?
Dialogue: 5,0:17:50.13,0:17:52.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I'd allow that.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:52.18,0:17:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd kick your ass before anyone else.
Dialogue: 5,0:17:57.34,0:18:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The only people who should put their own lives in danger are those who've got no other choice.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:03.81,0:18:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone else is just playing around.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:07.55,0:18:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's beyond moronic.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:08.48,0:18:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that how it is?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:10.48,0:18:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday, you might end up having to fight for your life whether you want to or not.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:17.53,0:18:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You should think about it when that time comes.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:20.24,0:18:21.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 5,0:18:33.75,0:18:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouko{*}-chan{*}, why did you—
Dialogue: 5,0:18:36.49,0:18:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,She knows we're here.
Dialogue: 5,0:18:37.42,0:18:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Here she comes!
Dialogue: 5,0:18:54.82,0:18:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do this like we planned, okay?
Dialogue: 5,0:18:57.36,0:18:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ri-Right...
Dialogue: 5,0:18:59.77,0:19:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{*}-chan{*}, it's me.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:02.39,0:19:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Madoka.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:04.06,0:19:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hear me?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:06.58,0:19:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you recognize my voice?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:11.21,0:19:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay strong.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:12.42,0:19:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep calling out to her!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:15.69,0:19:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{*}-chan{*}, stop it.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:17.88,0:19:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Please remember.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:19.97,0:19:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you never wanted to hurt anyone!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:23.75,0:19:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted to be a hero, right, Sayaka{*}-chan{*}?
Dialogue: 5,0:19:27.00,0:19:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Please go back to your old self!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:34.47,0:19:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Being stubborn will only\N get you so far, Sayaka!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:48.15,0:19:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouko{*}-chan{*}!
Dialogue: 5,0:19:51.14,0:19:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:52.58,0:19:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is nothing.
Dialogue: 5,0:19:54.92,0:19:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep calling out... to Sayaka...
Dialogue: 5,0:19:59.12,0:20:01.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Stop it!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:01.73,0:20:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{*}-chan{*}, open your eyes!
Dialogue: 5,0:20:09.57,0:20:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So you finally got the chance\N to pay me back, huh?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:13.14,0:20:18.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we {\i1}did{\i0} try to kill each other at first.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:18.70,0:20:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd be a wuss.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:20.73,0:20:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But no matter how much I beat on you, \Nyou always got right back up.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:26.66,0:20:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mad, aren't you?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:28.95,0:20:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't accept what's going on, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:32.45,0:20:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I know how you feel.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:35.08,0:20:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back to us when you feel better.
Dialogue: 5,0:20:38.12,0:20:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 5,0:20:50.24,0:20:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka{*}-chan{*}...
Dialogue: 5,0:20:52.05,0:20:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Please...
Dialogue: 5,0:20:55.46,0:20:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sayaka!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:00.11,0:21:06.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You said you believed this power could make people happy!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:17.56,0:21:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please, God...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:20.49,0:21:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After all I've been through...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:23.21,0:21:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I deserve a lucky break,\N even if it's just this one time.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:35.63,0:21:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouko!
Dialogue: 5,0:21:40.51,0:21:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:42.30,0:21:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you...
Dialogue: 5,0:21:43.44,0:21:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of her.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:45.95,0:21:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I made her go along with my idiocy.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:51.26,0:21:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You should never fight with a burden, right?
Dialogue: 5,0:21:55.36,0:21:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine. That's the right choice.
Dialogue: 5,0:21:58.79,0:22:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Just focus on the one thing you really want to protect and keep it safe 'til the end.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:05.62,0:22:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's funny.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:07.37,0:22:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All this time, that's what I thought I was doing.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:14.62,0:22:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:16.27,0:22:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take care of her.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:22.48,0:22:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Sayaka.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:25.73,0:22:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you don't want to be alone.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:29.90,0:22:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. I'll be here with you, Sayaka.
Dialogue: 5,0:22:58.07,0:22:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouko...
Dialogue: 5,0:23:10.35,0:23:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Was there really any chance for\N Sakura Kyouko to save Miki Sayaka?
Dialogue: 5,0:23:15.23,0:23:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:16.51,0:23:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,She should have known\N that it was impossible.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:19.45,0:23:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you stop her, then?
Dialogue: 5,0:23:22.58,0:23:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have stopped her from\N needlessly sacrificing herself, of course.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:26.24,0:23:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But in this case, getting her out of the picture served an important purpose.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:31.32,0:23:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're the only magical girl left to face the Walpurgisnacht.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:37.10,0:23:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And it goes without saying that\Nthere's no way you can win alone.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:40.58,0:23:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If this city is to be saved, Madoka has\Nno choice but to become a magical girl.
Dialogue: 5,0:23:46.86,0:23:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never let that happen. I swear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.96,0:23:56.00,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{ED}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.05,0:25:26.09,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 5,0:25:28.71,0:25:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}No one will believe the future.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:32.46,0:25:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}No one can accept the future.
Dialogue: 5,0:25:37.56,0:25:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an1}I will never depend on anyone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.96,0:02:36.73,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,480)}I'll walk upon this Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.73,0:02:38.80,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}and pierce this shadowy veil of unease,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.80,0:02:42.41,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}as many times as necessary
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.57,0:03:03.97,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}with these unwavering feelings
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.71,0:03:19.55,Opening-Connect-English,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}the beautiful blue sky will always be waiting for me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.30,0:02:01.72,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(200,0)}I'll never forget the promises we exchanged
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.72,0:02:04.18,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}I still see it when I close my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.18,0:02:05.80,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}I'll move forward as I cast off
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.80,0:02:09.68,Opening-Connect-English-blue,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,580)}this darkness engulfing me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.96,0:02:25.79,Opening-Connect-English-dreams,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(200,480)}How long will it be before
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.79,0:02:31.96,Opening-Connect-English-dreams,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,480)}I see that lost future again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.55,0:03:21.84,Opening-Connect-English-night,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5}So I won't be afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.84,0:03:27.97,Opening-Connect-English-night,,0,0,0,,{\blur3.5\fad(0,1020)}No matter what happens next, I won't give in
